WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.975
Each state is described by arrangement, motion and attraction of particles.

2
00:00:05.825 --> 00:00:10.150
In a solid, particles are close and fixed, vibrating in place.

3
00:00:11.962 --> 00:00:15.587
In a liquid, they are still close but slide past each other.

4
00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:25.966
In a gas, they are far apart and fast, spreading to fill any space.
